      "title": "Graduate Intern - Men's Lacrosse",
      "description": "Graduate Intern Men’s Lacrosse Assistant Coach\n\nBatten University | Virginia Beach, Virginia\n\nBatten University is seeking a motivated and energetic Assistant Men’s Lacrosse Coach to join our coaching staff.\n\nThis is an excellent opportunity for a coach looking to gain valuable NCAA coaching experience while pursuing a graduate degree. The position will work closely with the Head Men’s Lacrosse Coach in all aspects of building and developing a competitive collegiate lacrosse program.",
